   "source": [
    "# 42. Which Among These Is More Important Model Accuracy Or Model Performance?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "d4894431",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Model performance is more important than just model accuracy.\n",
    "\n",
    "Because:\n",
    "\n",
    "Accuracy is only one metric\n",
    "A model can have high accuracy but still perform poorly in real-world scenarios.\n",
    "🎯 Why Accuracy Alone Can Be Misleading\n",
    "🔹 Example: Imbalanced Dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "Suppose:\n",
    "\n",
    "99% Non-fraud\n",
    "1% Fraud\n",
    "\n",
    "If model predicts:\n",
    "\n",
    "“Non-fraud” for everything\n",
    "\n",
    "👉 Accuracy = 99% 😄\n",
    "👉 But model is useless ❌\n",
    "\n",
    "✅ What is Model Performance?\n",
    "\n",
    "Model performance includes:\n",
    "\n",
    "Accuracy\n",
    "Precision\n",
    "Recall\n",
    "F1-score\n",
    "ROC-AUC\n",
    "Latency\n",
    "Scalability\n",
    "Robustness\n",
    "Business impact\n",
    "📊 Different Problems Need Different Metrics\n",
    "Problem Type\tImportant Metric\n",
    "Fraud Detection\tRecall\n",
    "Medical Diagnosis\tRecall/Sensitivity\n",
    "Recommendation System\tPrecision@K\n",
    "Spam Detection\tPrecision\n",
    "Balanced Classification\tAccuracy/F1\n",
    "🚀 Real-world Perspective\n",
    "\n",
    "A good model should:\n",
    "\n",
    "Generalize well\n",
    "Handle unseen data\n",
    "Meet business requirements\n",
    "Be stable in production\n",
    "🔥 Example\n",
    "Medical Diagnosis\n",
    "Missing disease is dangerous\n",
    "\n",
    "👉 Recall matters more than accuracy.\n",
    "\n",
    "Recommendation System\n",
    "Relevant recommendations matter\n",
    "\n",
    "👉 Ranking metrics matter more.\n",
    "\n",
    "⚠️ Interview Trap\n",
    "\n",
    "If interviewer asks:\n",
    "👉 “Is 99% accuracy always good?”\n",
    "\n",
    "Answer:\n",
    "❌ No\n",
    "Need:\n",
    "\n",
    "Context\n",
    "Data distribution\n",
    "Business objective\n",
    "🎯 Interview-Ready Answer (Perfect)**\n",
    "\n",
    "👉 “Model performance is more important than accuracy because accuracy alone may be misleading, especially in imbalanced datasets. A good model should be evaluated using appropriate metrics such as precision, recall, F1-score, ROC-AUC, and real-world business impact depending on the problem.”\n",
    "\n",
    "🔥 Pro Tip\n",
    "\n",
    "👉 Say this to impress interviewer:\n",
    "\n",
    "👉 “The best evaluation metric depends on the business objective, not just statistical accuracy.”"
   ]
  },
